{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/h0aqE6j9qSwLJJPPHZuB6Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:53.238795+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/h0aqE6j9qSwLJJPPHZuB6Q","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>长安大学土木工程与智能建造学院竭诚欢迎校内外优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读我院硕士学位研究生和直接攻读博士学位研究生。为做好2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）接收工作，现将预报名有关事宜通知如下。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/23P5tB73tlB0SngdReC22hPJc8gUV7kC76cLd7jicvulranCBXHRJZFmzWDKdoSw57jWvItofxk93aB2qyNS800qA8RZ4pDwoUkjgQIbOXAk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQL8K8xHJgmCO0Pib8T5XYKc4WsjtoUjAAvAkGV1CZMhPPY6C0zk6VMUxBbRLsvsx8GDN0Lds9C3tico9RUbuh2kib9ibFJAJuOFDzA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 学术型：081400 土木工程</span></p><p><span>2. 专业型：085900土木水利</span></p><p><span>    085901土木工程</span></p><p><span>    085905市政工程（含给排水等）</span></p><p><span>    085906人工环境工程（含供热、通风及空调等） </span></p><p><span>    实际招生专业和研究方向以我校正式发布的2027年招生简章和专业目录为准。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQL8K8xHJgmCO0Pib8T5XYKc4WsjtoUjAAvAkGV1CZMhPPY6C0zk6VMUxBbRLsvsx8GDN0Lds9C3tico9RUbuh2kib9ibFJAJuOFDzA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领 导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></p><p><span>2.2027届普通全日制本科毕业生，有望取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格；</span></p><p><span>3.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p><p><span>4.身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求；</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQL8K8xHJgmCO0Pib8T5XYKc4WsjtoUjAAvAkGV1CZMhPPY6C0zk6VMUxBbRLsvsx8GDN0Lds9C3tico9RUbuh2kib9ibFJAJuOFDzA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.申请人请于</span><span><span>2026年9月15日</span></span><span>前登录长安大学推免生预报名系统（https://yzfw.chd.edu.cn:9091/xly/），填写有关信息、上传附件材料并提交申请。</span></p><p><span>2.学院将根据上级政策开展考核选拔工作，具体时间及工作安排后续发布。申请人须在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”正式报名，完成填报志愿、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节，服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></p><p><span>3. 有意向申请我院2027年推免研究生的同学请加入QQ群：长大土木学院2026年预推免群</span><span><span>（群号193915677）</span></span><span>，申请入群请备注信息: 姓名+本科学校。其他后续工作安排将在群中通知。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQL8K8xHJgmCO0Pib8T5XYKc4WsjtoUjAAvAkGV1CZMhPPY6C0zk6VMUxBbRLsvsx8GDN0Lds9C3tico9RUbuh2kib9ibFJAJuOFDzA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请人将以下材料按照1-5项顺序整理成一个PDF文件（不超过10M），上传推免生预报名系统。</span></p><p><span>1.个人简历、身份证和学生证；</span></p><p><span>2.本科成绩单和总评成绩排名证明(由教务处盖章或所在学院盖章)；</span></p><p><span>3.外语水平证明材料（如英语专四/专八、雅思/托福，或日语专四/专八、N1/N2等）；</span></p><p><span>4.学术科研成果（公开发表的论文等）和获奖证书；</span></p><p><span>5.参加社会实践、公益事业等的证明材料；</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQL8K8xHJgmCO0Pib8T5XYKc4WsjtoUjAAvAkGV1CZMhPPY6C0zk6VMUxBbRLsvsx8GDN0Lds9C3tico9RUbuh2kib9ibFJAJuOFDzA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.未尽事宜以长安大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知为准，网址https://yzb.chd.edu.cn/2026/0723/c2769a262101/page.htm，我院将根据教育部最新推免生政策，及时公布2027年接收推免生的最新信息，请关注我校研究生院网站相关信息。</span></p><p><span>2. 直接攻读博士研究生招生专业、导师名单可参考《长安大学2026年博士研究生招生简章》及学院的专业目录，申请人应提前与报考导师联系并征得同意。</span></p><p><span>3.申请人应保证填报信息、申请材料的真实性和准确性。对于提供虚假报考信息或不符合申请条件的考生，一经查实，取消申请资格、考核资格等。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>联系人：张老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：029-82337305</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/6LiaEAplUaanFeS6TE1DdZGZuJWyRJuLXmwkx4xxU6WHqefM9gibnBteEWaycUKDHsDasxM6nNJZfTtoql8wxHQg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>建工研会</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>图文来源 |</span></p><p><span>编辑 |</span></p><p><span>初审 |</span></p><p><span>复审 |</span></p><p><span>终审 |</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span> 土木学院官网</span></p><p><span> 钮文旭</span></p><p><span> 史欣欣  钮文旭 </span></p><p><span> 闫   可</span></p><p><span> 马熠航</span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/U8Vt95qrjzw28VlK3suKCq0FU0r6yxscHu5wLOj9b0nFwfjPn7Csb9hjuVtVsTyxPEAyTtUETah8AySkMheiar1gGAVDjVtE1Vvy68c6zwmU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b8d776a4d87f6530dcae8aabef517f70c5f7510f3d67d6cdfcc0e08cc396db53","textLength":1189,"sourceSha256":"942364b5cba83d14a5bae9639a4a36b4f6cad15c16ba9ce744e90ec5dfff471a","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ce356c31b31f08669bcc","title":"2026年长安大学土木工程与智能建造学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:53.238795+00:00"}
